mut IRSB_B : [i64; 8]   = [0; 8]   ## the array local's base slot (off)
mut IRSB_N := 0

## Vec-LOCAL increment — per-fn GENERAL STATEMENT-BARRIER side-table. A Vec-build statement the scalar-leaf
## IR does NOT model (`v := alloc::vec::with_capacity(…)`, a `v.push(x)` ExprStmt, the `mmap`/`arena_over`
## chain) is spliced VERBATIM through the text emitter (`emit_stmts`) at render, bracketed by a FULL-CLOBBER
## IR inst (op 24). The statement writes its result into its FRAME slots (the aggregate stays in memory — the
