  ## live across a call, or a spilling leaf). Spill slots occupy -8..-8*nsp(%rbp) (RA_SPILL_BASE = -8);
  ## the callee-save slots sit BELOW them at -8*(nsp+1), -8*(nsp+2), … in the fixed order rbx,r12..r15.
  nsp := regalloc::ra_spill_slots()
