  ## A ROOT-level `_start` already IS `_start` (Modules §6.1 — unprefixed), so the alias would be a
  ## second `_start:` label on the same instruction and `as` rejects the file. See emit_fn's note.
  if d.name_len != 0 and (not is_root_mod(d.mod_start, d.mod_len)) and str_at((cx.src + d.name_start), d.name_len) == "_start" {
